{'symbol': 'HCA', 'date': '2021-10-13 08:30:00', 'title': "HCA HEALTHCARE ANNOUNCES $1 MILLION GIFT TO NASHVILLE RESCUE MISSION'S NEW WOMEN'S SHELTER", 'text': "NASHVILLE, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HCA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE:HCA), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HEALTHCARE PROVIDERS, AND THE HCA HEALTHCARE FOUNDATION TODAY ANNOUNCED A $1 MILLION DONATION TO NASHVILLE RESCUE MISSION'S NEW WOMEN'S SHELTER EXPECTED TO OPEN IN LATE 2023. “AT HCA HEALTHCARE, WE BELIEVE THAT THERE ARE MANY WAYS TO CHAMPION HEALTH. NASHVILLE RESCUE MISSION IS AN IMPORTANT INSTITUTION IN OUR COMMUNITY, AND WE'RE HONORED TO BE A PART OF ITS NEW CAMPUS FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN,” SAID SA"}